    "name": "Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter",
    "steam_appid": 3599220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter</strong> is a <strong>simple</strong> fps game with roguelite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is locked, you get to pick any weapon, map and game mode right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you get to upgrade your weapon base stats (fire rate, damage, etc.) from a random selection and try to survive as long as possible, difficulty increasing the further you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.poster.avif?t=1750110905\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.webm?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.mp4?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or Co-op up to 4 players. LAN or host games through Steam subsystem</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different maps, 3 for each game mode and\u00a017 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Roam freely and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Trapped in a corner or an alley and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Mode:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Black Ops zombie mode insipired mode where you fight waves of zombies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter</strong> is a <strong>simple</strong> fps game with roguelite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is locked, you get to pick any weapon, map and game mode right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you get to upgrade your weapon base stats (fire rate, damage, etc.) from a random selection and try to survive as long as possible, difficulty increasing the further you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.poster.avif?t=1750110905\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.webm?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.mp4?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or Co-op up to 4 players. LAN or host games through Steam subsystem</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different maps, 3 for each game mode and\u00a017 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Roam freely and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Trapped in a corner or an alley and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Mode:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Black Ops zombie mode insipired mode where you fight waves of zombies.</p>",
    "short_description": "Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter is here to scratch your FPS itch! Pick a weapon of your choice and start blasting endless amounts of zombies. The game has 3 game modes and Vampire Survivors mechanics! Solo or multiplayer up to 4 players!",
